  <h6>Welcome to Milenge Secondary School</h6>
<p> Milenge Secondary School is a government institution dedicated to nurturing the leaders of 
  tomorrow. Established in 2013, our school has grown to become a beacon of educational excellence 
  for students in Grades Eight through Twelve. Our commitment to academic rigor, discipline, and personal 
  growth defines our school culture. </p>
Our Vision and Values
<p> Our vision is to shape responsible, knowledgeable, and innovative students who will make a meaningful 
  impact on society. We believe in fostering a sense of integrity, respect, and hard work in every student,
  ensuring they leave our school equipped with the skills necessary for a successful future. </p>
World-Class Facilities
<p> Milenge Secondary School boasts modern classrooms, fully equipped science and computer labs, a 
  state-of-the-art library, and expansive sports facilities. These resources allow students to explore a 
  wide range of interests while excelling academically. We are continually updating our infrastructure to 
  provide the best learning environment possible. </p>
Holistic Education
<p> Beyond academics, we offer a variety of extracurricular programs, from sports teams to debate clubs, 
  arts, and music. Our goal is to encourage students to discover their talents and build well-rounded 
  individuals who can adapt to any challenge. </p>
Community and Alumni
<p> We are proud of our strong community ties and the achievements of our alumni, who have gone on to excel 
  in various fields. Our school encourages students to get involved in community service projects, further 
  reinforcing the values of giving back and leadership. </p>
</div>
